  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center of Excellence for Energy (COEE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Egypt):  The Center of Excellence for Energy will transform Egyptian public universities into world-class institutes for energy studies, developing innovative applied research that informs energy policy and private sector innovation, and generating local solutions for Egypt&apos;s energy challenges. The Center of Excellence for Energy will support Egypt&apos;s economic development by establishing partnerships between Egyptian and American universities. The Center will enable Egyptian universities to generate energy research that meets the public and private sector needs. Finally, the Center will train highly skilled graduates to meet the evolving needs of industry, government and their communities. .This activity is contributing to the higher education partnership directive..</narrative>
  </description>
